  └──────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Written test-first, per the repo's TDD practice — each test fails before the behavior exists.

  [1mNot covered, stated plainly:[0m the form submit path, the [38;5;153mawait[39m in the handler, and the [38;5;153mindex.html[39m script ordering. Those
